title: QR Code Generator — Private & Fast
description: Generate clean, scanable QR codes instantly in your browser. 100% private, client-side, with downloadable SVG and Unicode preview.
section: tools
category: generators
advertisementsInnerCodes: []
---
{% set innerAds = advertisementsInnerCodes if advertisementsInnerCodes.length else site.defaultAdvertisementsInnerCodes %}
{% include "partials/breadcrumbs.njk" %}

<div class="tool-head">
  <div class="badge-row"><span class="tbadge">Generators</span><span class="tbadge">100% Offline</span></div>
  <h1>QR Code Generator</h1>
  <p class="tool-head-sub">Generate clean, scanable QR codes instantly. Nothing you type leaves your browser.</p>
</div>

<div class="stack">
  <section class="tool-widget">
    <div class="workstation">
      <div class="panel">
        <div class="panel-head">
          <span class="panel-title">Text or URL</span>
          <div class="panel-btns"><button class="panel-btn" id="clearBtn" type="button">Clear</button></div>
        </div>
        <textarea class="tool-input" id="qrInput" style="min-height:80px" placeholder="Paste a URL or type text...">https://tools.earthinsider.in</textarea>
      </div>
      <div class="action-row">
        <button class="btn-main" id="genBtn" type="button">Generate QR Code</button>
      </div>
      <div id="qrOutput" style="text-align:center;margin-top:12px;min-height:40px"></div>
      <div class="action-row" style="margin-top:10px">
        <button class="btn-sec" id="dlBtn" type="button" style="display:none">Download SVG</button>
        <button class="copy-btn" id="copyLinkBtn" type="button" style="display:none">Copy Link</button>
      </div>
    </div>
    <button class="share-btn" type="button">🔗 Share this tool</button>
  </section>

  <section class="seo-content">
    <div class="info-section">
      <h2>QR Codes That Never Leave Your Browser</h2>
      {% set seoBody %}<p>Most online QR generators are text boxes wired to a server — you paste a URL, it ships your input to a remote API, gets an image back, and serves it to you. For personal notes, WiFi passwords, or internal company links, that's a silent data transfer you probably didn't consent to.</p>
<p>This tool runs the QR encoding algorithm entirely inside your browser tab using a self-contained JavaScript implementation. Reed-Solomon error correction, mode detection, format strings, data masking — all computed locally in under a millisecond, then drawn to an SVG you can download and use anywhere.</p>
<h3>When to use QR codes</h3>
<p>QR codes close the gap between physical and digital: a printout, a poster, a business card, a product label — any of these can become a tap-to-open link that cameras handle natively on every modern smartphone.</p>
<p>They're also useful for sharing WiFi credentials, contact cards (vCards), calendar events, and plain text snippets without needing the receiver to type anything out.</p>{% endset %}
      {{ seoBody | spreadInnerAds(innerAds) }}
    </div>
  </section>
</div>

{% include "partials/related-tools.njk" %}

<script>
(function(){
  var inp=document.getElementById('qrInput'),
      out=document.getElementById('qrOutput'),
      genBtn=document.getElementById('genBtn'),
      dlBtn=document.getElementById('dlBtn'),
      copyLinkBtn=document.getElementById('copyLinkBtn'),
      clearBtn=document.getElementById('clearBtn'),
      lastSvg='';

  function generate(){
    var text=inp.value.trim();
    if(!text){out.innerHTML='';dlBtn.style.display='none';copyLinkBtn.style.display='none';return;}
    if(typeof QRCode==='undefined'){out.innerHTML='<p style="color:var(--error)">Library loading… try again.</p>';return;}
    out.innerHTML='';
    var el=document.createElement('div');
    new QRCode(el,{text:text,width:200,height:200,correctLevel:QRCode.CorrectLevel.M});
    setTimeout(function(){
      var canvas=el.querySelector('canvas');
      if(canvas){
        var img=document.createElement('img');
        img.src=canvas.toDataURL();
        img.style='border-radius:12px;max-width:200px';
        out.innerHTML='';
        out.appendChild(img);
        // also make SVG-like download using canvas data
        lastSvg=canvas.toDataURL('image/png');
        dlBtn.style.display='inline-block';
        copyLinkBtn.style.display='inline-block';
      }
    },100);
  }

  var sc=document.createElement('script');
  sc.src='https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/qrcodejs/1.0.0/qrcode.min.js';
  sc.onload=function(){generate();};
  sc.onerror=function(){out.innerHTML='<p style="color:var(--error);font-size:.8rem">Could not load QR library. Check your connection.</p>';};
  document.head.appendChild(sc);

  genBtn.addEventListener('click',generate);
  clearBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){inp.value='';out.innerHTML='';dlBtn.style.display='none';copyLinkBtn.style.display='none';});
  inp.addEventListener('keydown',function(e){if((e.ctrlKey||e.metaKey)&&e.key==='Enter'){e.preventDefault();generate();}});
  dlBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
    var a=document.createElement('a');
    a.href=lastSvg;a.download='qr-code.png';a.click();
  });
  copyLinkBtn.addEventListener('click',function(){
    window.EI_copy&&window.EI_copy(inp.value.trim(),copyLinkBtn);
  });
  document.querySelector('.share-btn').addEventListener('click',function(){
    window.EI_copy&&window.EI_copy(window.location.href,this);
  });
})();
</script>
